# Generated clients (ADR-0007) are produced from openapi/*.yaml by
# `pnpm --filter @nia/types run generate` and are NEVER edited by hand. They are
# COMMITTED so a fresh clone and the verify gate work without a JDK; CI regenerates
# and checks drift. Only the Dart package's local build/tool artifacts are ignored.
generated/nia.combined.yaml
generated/wallet.bundled.yaml
generated/dart/.dart_tool/
generated/dart/build/
generated/dart/pubspec.lock
generated/dart/.packages
